sentation or undue influence. The evidence is insufficient to show that the plaintiff-respondent was tricked or gypped by the appellants to execute the impugned deed-it appears that the trial Judge had been obnoxious to those important facts",SRC030-s35(1),none,headnote,ratio,high,headnote,unverified
